# ad10 teaser — ~32s (X / short-form)
#
# Total segments: 8

[00:00.0 --> 00:02.0]
From zero, on a clock:

[00:02.0 --> 00:05.0]
one brew install,

[00:05.0 --> 00:08.0]
one binary running,

[00:08.0 --> 00:14.0]
one markdown file -- and your agent is live on Slack.

[00:14.0 --> 00:19.0]
Real question, real answer, on the channel your team already uses.

[00:19.0 --> 00:24.0]
Then share its terminal -- live, view or control --

[00:24.0 --> 00:27.5]
and manage it from any shell.

[00:27.5 --> 00:31.9]
One binary. Reachable from everywhere. rysh dot A I.
